; The CLIENT/isomorphic half of a Page (Page.serve is the server half): read the server-seeded
; payload back as a typed value, decoded with the same Codec the server encoded with. Pure
; (Fur.Data + Codec + Bson_json), so it links into a page's jsoo bundle AND the server SSR.

(library
 (name fennec_web_client)
 (public_name fennec.web.client)
 (wrapped false)
 (libraries fennec.fur fennec.pulse.codec fennec-mongo.bson_json))
